               <p xml:id="idm258">In his autograph score Hartmann gave this work opus number 49. In Angul Hammerich's list of works it is erroneously called opus 46 which has been adopted by Alfred Nielsen, Sven Lunn, William Behrend and Dan Fog, who names the printed collection "Liturgisk Musik" 1881, opus 49 without explanation. Hartmann assigned the opus number 46 to the Collects and Responsories composed 1847-1848.</p>
