               <physMedium xml:id="physMedium_50b0dc2b">Vocal parts bound in brown paper, many of them with the name of the singer written on the first music page. One of the tenor parts is signed E. Brennecke 14/2 80, which indicates a performance at that day. One of the organ parts is bound in brown cardboard with green cloth on the spine. Handwritten label with the monogram of King Christian X. On the title page of this copy "A 111 - 5. Pkl. 6" has been added.</physMedium>
